# M-SOV03 -- W2-CA-01 (EnteredBy on a building) + W2-CA-04 (map rules overlay)
# + W2-CA-13 (SellBuilding). SOV03u started directly (W2-CA-19 `set campaign`):
# an engineer captures the Allied Battle Lab -> "Entered Battle Lab" -> the lab
# is sold -> Other3 raises the Psychic Beacon (map [NAPSYB] Cost=50) -> defend
# it until the Allies are converted -> WON. Cheats only skip combat (enemy
# units removed between attack waves) and place the engineer near the lab;
# the capture itself is the real World engineer order.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov03u.MAP Nod

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
until 900 objectives >= 1
cheat camp_killu 1 *
cheat camp_spawn SENGINEER 0 104 31
wait 5
assert units(0) == 2
cheat camp_capture SENGINEER 1 GATECH
until 1200 buildings(0) >= 3
assert units(0) == 1
until 900 objectives >= 2
assert outcome == RUNNING
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat camp_killu 1 *
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat camp_killu 2 *
wait 300
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat camp_killu 1 *
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat camp_killu 2 *
wait 300
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat camp_killu 1 *
if outcome == RUNNING then cheat camp_killu 2 *
wait 300
